                <invention-title lang="de">ANZEIGESUBSTRAT UND HERSTELLUNGSVERFAHREN DAFÜR SOWIE ANZEIGEVORRICHTUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SUBSTRAT D'AFFICHAGE ET SON PROCÉDÉ DE FABRICATION, ET DISPOSITIF D'AFFICHAGE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">DISPLAY SUBSTRATE, PREPARATION METHOD THEREFOR, AND DISPLAY DEVICE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A display substrate and a manufacturing method thereof, and a display device are disclosed. The display substrate includes a base substrate (1000), a plurality of sub-pixels (110), a plurality of data lines (1101), a plurality of data leads (1220), at least one group of contact pads (1210), and a first insulation layer (1230). The base substrate (1000) includes a display region (1100) and a bonding region (1200) located at at least one side of the display region (1100). The plurality of data lines (1101) are configured to provide data signals to the plurality of sub-pixels (110). The plurality of data leads (1220) are located in the bonding region (1200) and are electrically connected with the plurality of data lines (1101). The least one group of contact pads includes a plurality of contact pads (1210), at least one of the plurality of contact pads (1210) includes a first contact pad metal layer (1215) and a second contact pad metal layer (1217), the second contact pad metal layer (1217) covers an edge of the first contact pad metal layer (1215). The first insulation layer (1230) is located in the bonding region (1200). The first insulation layer (1230) is located in gaps between the plurality of contact pads (1210) and covers edges of the plurality of contact pads (1210), and is configured to expose surfaces of the plurality of contact pads (1210) facing away from the base substrate.</p>
            </abstract>
